     A***                                  3'Instructions:'
     A***                                   FNTCHRSET(C0H20080 T1V10037)
     A***                                   SKIPB(78)
     A***                                  3'Enter the payroll for each class -
     A***                                   code into column (3). Multiply by -
     A***                                   the rate in column (4), and then -
     A***                                   by .01, round to the nearest -
     A***                                   dollar, and place the result in -
     A***                                   column (5). Total the premium'
     A***                                   FNTCHRSET(C0H20070 T1V10037)
     A***                                   SKIPB(79)

     A***                                  3'in column (5), and enter the -
     A***                                   result in box (6). Multiply box -
     A***                                   (6) by the Increased limits percent-
     A***                                   age, round to the nearest dollar, -
     A***                                   and place the result in box (7). -
     A***                                   Add box (7) to box (6), and'
     A***                                   FNTCHRSET(C0H20070 T1V10037)
     A***                                   SKIPB(80)

     A***                                  3'place the result in Subtotal box -
     A***                                   (8). Multiply box (8) by the -
     A***                                   Discount factor before modifier -
     A***                                   (9), round to the nearest dollar, -
     A***                                   and place the result in Subtotal -
     A***                                   box (10). Multiply box (10)'
     A***                                   FNTCHRSET(C0H20070 T1V10037)
     A***                                   SKIPB(81)

     A***                                  3'by Experience modifier (11), round-
     A***                                    to the nearest dollar, and place -
     A***                                   in Subtotal box (12). Multiply box -
     A***                                   (12) by the Discount factor after -
     A***                                   modifier (13), round to the nearest-
     A***                                    dollar, and place'
     A***                                   FNTCHRSET(C0H20070 T1V10037)
     A***                                   SKIPB(82)

     A***                                  3'the result in Total Premium Due -
     A***                                   (14). For box (15), the total repor-
     A***                                   ted payrolls (minus per capita payr-
     A***                                   olls) must be dividied by 100 and -
     A***                                   then multiplied by the Foreign Terr-
     A***                                   orism rate and '
     A***                                   FNTCHRSET(C0H20070 T1V10037)
     A***                                   SKIPB(83)

     A***                                  3'rounded to the nearest dollar. Mul-
     A***                                   tiply the State Tax % by box (14) -
     A***                                   and box (15) and place the result -
     A***                                   in box (16). Add the Previous Balan-
     A***                                   ce from box (17) to box (14) thru -
     A***                                   box (16 ). Place'
     A***                                   FNTCHRSET(C0H20070 T1V10037)
     A***                                   SKIPB(84)

     A***                                  3'the result in box (18). Please -
     A***                                   attach a check for this amount -
     A***                                   to the completed form and return.'
     A***                                   FNTCHRSET(C0H20070 T1V10037)
     A***                                   SKIPB(85)
