     A                                      code into column(3). Multiply col-
     A                                      umn(3) by the rate in column(4), -
     A                                      then multiply that result by .01. -
     A                                      Round the result to '
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H40080 T1V10037)
     A                                      SKIPB(79)

     A    N45                              3'the nearest dollar and enter the -
     A                                      result in column(5). Add the -
     A                                      results from column(5) and enter -
     A                                      into box(6). Add (or subtract if -
     A                                      CR) any Previous Balance'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H40080 T1V10037)
     A                                      SKIPB(80)

     A    N45                              3'from box(9) to box(6) and enter -
     A                                      the result in box(11). Sign and -
     A                                      date the bottom of the form and -
     A                                      return along with a check for the -
     A                                      amount in box(11), '
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H40080 T1V10037)
     A                                      SKIPB(81)

     A    N45                              3'payable to Care West Ins. Co. -
     A                                      IMPORTANT: Previous Balance in -
     A                                      box(9) must be included with -
     A                                      your payment to prevent Cancel-
     A                                      lation.'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H40080 T1V10037)
     A                                      SKIPB(82)

     A                                    75'Page:'
     A                                      FNTCHRSET(C0H20080 T1V10037)
     A                                      SKIPB(86)
